---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Keys">
  <h1>Recipient keys</h1>
  <p>
    The sender will accept one RSA-3072 or RSA-4096 SPKI PUBLIC KEY PEM with
    exponent 65537. Verify its full SHA-256 fingerprint through a trusted
    channel.
  </p>
  <p>
    Never paste private keys or passphrases into the website. Encrypted private
    keys belong only in the separately verified offline receiver. Key setup
    instructions and receiver readiness checks are pending.
  </p>
  <p>
    For portable Windows key setup, generate a random 24–32 character ASCII
    passphrase with a trusted local password manager or cryptographic random
    generator. Eight characters is too weak. Length alone does not establish
    entropy: predictable phrases and patterns remain guessable. Use independent
    temporary and final passphrases and retain a protected backup outside the
    key file. Non-ASCII bytes can differ between OpenSSL's interactive console
    and the receiver; that interactive compatibility has not yet been tested.
    UTF-8 synthetic file fixtures passing does not establish console
    compatibility.
  </p>
</Layout>
